## What We Are Building

Validating the full Designer chain end-to-end on SS-S15-E01 «Heavy Friend» episode and closing UX/autonomy gaps surfaced during the live run. Three intertwined work streams:

1. **Designer chain validation** — SH01..SH06 of 22 shots produced via full Sprint Designer pipeline (Plan → Director review → execute-from-plan → IMG → Director review). 6 IMG-episode_ref assets generated, 5 APPROVED, 1 in REVISION (SH04 ждёт regen after Director's quality feedback).

2. **Polina autonomy hardening (TD-25)** — Director observed Polina silently waiting when expected events never fire. Built three layers of fix: P1 open-loop awareness in system prompt, P3 detector + UI yellow chip, P2 watchdog cron escalates after 90s. Director correctly flagged regex-based detector as «почти моветон» for LLM work — TD-25 P4 (structured `markAwaitingDirector` PA tool) deferred for next session.

3. **Bug sweeps (TD-23/24/26/27/29)** — three classes of bugs revealed during smoke: (a) strict `===` on file_type that includes shot_id suffix (TD-24, 2 sites fixed, 4 in backlog); (b) UI/state desync where one widget reads from a different source than another (TD-26 pictogram, TD-27 modal); (c) direct `activity_events.insert` calls bypassing `logEvent` helper, breaking Polina's auto-react chain (TD-29 root cause, 2 sites fixed, 7 prod sites in backlog).

