- **Designer chain end-to-end on 6 shots** — confirmed by: DB shows 6 SPC-ref_plan APPROVED + 6 IMG-episode_ref (5 APPROVED, 1 REVISION) for SS-S15-E01; activity_events trail clean from REV-world_check.APPROVED → fan-out → Plan creation → Director approve → execute-from-plan → IMG creation.
