- **TD-25 P1 open-loop awareness in prompt** — confirmed by: Director's «ЧЕГО ЖДЕШЬ» reply triggered Polina to RE-CHECK context (calling `findEpisode`, `getEpisode`) instead of repeating prior passive «жду», ultimately self-corrected the episode_id desync. Without P1 she would have repeated «жду».
- **TD-25 P3 yellow chip** — confirmed by: Polina's 08:46:29 turn with q3 question stamped `metadata.awaiting_director_input=YES` per `check-watchdog-state.ts`. UI would render the chip (not visually verified by Director yet).
