## What Did NOT Work (and why)

- **First Designer fan-out attempt (08:00-ish UTC)** — failed because: `assets_file_type_check` constraint rejected file_type with uppercase shot_id (`SPC-ref_plan-SS-S15-E01-A1-SC01-SH01`). 10× failures cascaded. **Fixed** by migration 0034 (`e5ffa22`, landed yesterday).
- **Polina's manual triggerAgent at 14:24 (yesterday) on EXEC-EREF instead of EXEC-EREF-DESIGNER** — failed because: wrong agent_id, old pipeline (Artist) instead of new (Designer). Was a Polina UX failure now mitigated by P1 prompt.
- **`replay-execute-from-plan.ts` first run** — failed because: TD-24 strict-compare bug in `lib/agents/runners/episode-references.ts:774` (`data.file_type !== 'SPC-ref_plan'`). **Fixed** by adding `.startsWith('SPC-ref_plan-')` check, then second replay succeeded.
- **~~Polina's hallucinated shotIds (`SC01-SH03/04` instead of real `SC02-SH03/04`)~~** — **RESOLVED 2026-05-21 ~13:25 UTC.** Director audit on this session: in turns 09:12..09:24 UTC Polina operated `SS-S15-E01-A2-SC03-SH07/SH08`, distinguished Plan vs Image, quoted UUIDs (`1177690c-…`, `ae4e87d0-…`) without error. No re-occurrence after the initial day-prior incident. Keeping the entry as historical context, but it's not a live issue.
- **Polina passive on auto-react: "не буду выдумывать какой именно агент и какой ассет"** (turns 09:14:17 + 09:17:41) — **RESOLVED 2026-05-21 ~13:30 UTC by Fix A+B+C in `lib/concierge/system-prompt-builder.ts`** (commit pending). Root cause: (a) `pipelineEvents` block in system prompt serialized only `content` from `concierge_turns`, dropping `metadata.asset_id`/`actor`/`event_type` — Polina saw the title but had no UUID to call `getAsset` with; (b) `AUTO_REACT_GUIDANCE` didn't explicitly invite read-only follow-up; (c) `BASE_BEHAVIOR` "NEVER fabricate" rule over-applied because no exemption for "source is visible". Fix: emit a per-event `refs:` line with structured fields, rewrite AUTO_REACT_GUIDANCE to encourage `getAsset(asset_id)` + getRecentActivityEvents follow-up, add "no source is visible" caveat to fabrication rule. 4 new unit tests; vitest 352/352, tsc clean. Live validation: next auto-react after Director approve should produce a concrete asset+status summary instead of "не знаю".
- **Detector regex pattern v1** — too narrow, missed «мониторю появление» phrasing. **Fixed in P3.5** by extending pattern, but Director rightly called this anti-pattern overall — proper fix (TD-25 P4) is a structured PA tool, not regex.
- **PA tool `regenerateImage` was NOT auto-fired** after `requestRevision` set SH04 to REVISION. Director expected atomic operation but Polina split it into 2 steps and waited 8 min silently. **Mitigated by P1 prompt fix** which teaches her to treat «регенерируй» as atomic; full fix is TD-29 retire of regex detector.
- **Director's 08:42-08:43 approves on SH05/SH06 IMG** did NOT wake Polina for 13 minutes — root cause **TD-29 hot-fix** (just landed); validation pending in next session.

